{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21566","headline":"贬江陵途中寄乐天杓直杓直以员外郎判盐铁乐天以拾遗在翰林 · 元稹","name":"贬江陵途中寄乐天杓直杓直以员外郎判盐铁乐天以拾遗在翰林","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"想到江陵无一事，酒杯书卷缀新文。\n紫芽嫩茗和枝采，朱橘香苞数瓣分。\n暇日上山狂逐鹿，凌晨过寺饱看云。\n算缗草诏终须解，不敢将心远羡君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21566.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21566","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}